- Updated docker-compose.yml health check intervals to 60s (from 30s/10s) to reduce overhead
- Standardized health check timeouts to 15s across all services
- Standardized retries to 3 across all services
- Fixed Apollo Server health check to use GraphQL introspection query instead of non-existent /health endpoint
- Updated Python framework health checks to use Python urllib instead of curl
- Ensured all framework services explicitly use fraiseql-benchmark network
- Fixed port mapping for Strawberry (8011:8000)

Infrastructure improvements:
- Created MONITORING_LINKS.md with quick reference for dashboards and endpoints
- Fixed verify-frameworks.sh script with correct container name mappings
- Added framework-specific health check endpoints mapping

These changes ensure consistent health check behavior across all 9 frameworks and reduce resource overhead from frequent health checks.
